{% doc %}
  The Request-for-quote modal. Rendered ONCE per page from `theme.liquid`, so every entry point
  (quick order list, bulk order, cart page, cart drawer) shares one instance and one contact form.

  Nothing here knows where the items came from — callers push them into the store.

  No section needs that today: a `[data-quote-request-open]` button carrying a `data-quote-source`
  is the supported entry point and the boot script below already handles it end to end.

  A quote request is not an order. Quantity rules and volume pricing are rendered read-only and
  are never enforced: the shopper may ask to be quoted any quantity. See `quote-request.js`.

  The product table is the bulk-order table by design, so it reuses that section's class names and
  stylesheet instead of growing a second copy of ~250 lines of table CSS. That is why
  `bulk-order.css` is linked below even on pages with no bulk-order section.

  The form is a real Shopify contact form so the platform emits `form_type` and `utf8`; the store
  POSTs it with fetch instead of letting the browser navigate, which would otherwise wipe the
  quantities the shopper has typed into the table behind the modal.

  LAZY BY DEFAULT — same idea as the mini cart, taken one step further. The mini cart defers only
  its satellite scripts (`cart-drawer.js` → `_watchLazyScript`); here the modal is never on screen
  until it is asked for, so the stylesheet, the 35KB `quote-request.js` AND the markup itself all
  stay off the main thread until the shopper clicks a `[data-quote-request-open]` button. What the
  page actually pays on load is the small boot script below. See its comment for the ordering rule.

  @param {string} [can_request_quote] - 'true'/'false' from `can-request-quote`, already resolved
    by the caller. Falls back to resolving it here when omitted, so the snippet stays safe alone.
{% enddoc %}

{%- if can_request_quote != nil -%}
  {%- assign quote_can_request = can_request_quote -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- capture quote_can_request -%}{%- render 'can-request-quote' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign quote_can_request = quote_can_request | strip -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if quote_can_request == 'true' -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign quote_form_id = 'QuoteRequestForm'

    assign quote_money_format = shop.money_format | strip_html
    if settings.currency_code_enable
      assign quote_money_format = shop.money_with_currency_format | strip_html
    endif
  -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Boot script — the whole reason this modal no longer shows up in TBT.

    `quote-request.css` and `quote-request.js` used to be a render-blocking <link> and a 35KB
    defer script on EVERY page a B2B customer loaded, and the modal markup was a live Alpine tree
    Alpine had to walk before the page went interactive. None of it was needed until someone
    clicked "Request a quote", so none of it ships until then.

    The order below is load-bearing: assets first, markup second. Injecting the template earlier
    would let Alpine's mutation observer walk bindings such as `$store.xQuoteRequest.show` before
    the store exists and every one of them would throw.

    This is also the ONLY `[data-quote-request-open]` delegate in the theme — `quote-request.js`
    deliberately ships without one, so a click never runs the readers twice.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <script>
    (() => {
      const STYLESHEET = {{ 'quote-request.css' | asset_url | json }};
      const SCRIPT = {{ 'quote-request.js' | asset_url | json }};
      let booting = null;

      // `onerror` resolves too: a missing asset must not leave the button spinning forever.
      const loadTag = (tag) =>
        new Promise((resolve) => {
          tag.onload = tag.onerror = resolve;
          document.head.appendChild(tag);
        });

      const loadStylesheet = () => {
        if (document.querySelector('link[data-quote-request-style]')) return Promise.resolve();
        const link = document.createElement('link');
        link.rel = 'stylesheet';
        link.href = STYLESHEET;
        link.setAttribute('data-quote-request-style', '');
        return loadTag(link);
      };

      const loadScript = () => {
        const script = document.createElement('script');
        script.src = SCRIPT;
        return loadTag(script);
      };

      // Alpine may not have booted yet on a very early click; the store has to be registerable.
      const whenAlpine = () =>
        window.Alpine
          ? Promise.resolve()
          : new Promise((resolve) => document.addEventListener('alpine:init', resolve, { once: true }));

      // Alpine's own mutation observer initialises the injected tree — calling `initTree` here
      // as well would bind every directive twice.
      const injectMarkup = () => {
        const template = document.getElementById('QuoteRequestModal__Template');
        if (!template) return;
        template.parentNode.insertBefore(template.content.cloneNode(true), template.nextSibling);
        template.remove();
      };

      const boot = () => {
        if (!booting) {
          stopPrefetching();
          booting = whenAlpine()
            .then(() => Promise.all([loadStylesheet(), loadScript()]))
            .then(injectMarkup);
        }
        return booting;
      };

      // Mirrors `_setOpenBusy` in quote-request.js so the very first click — the only one that
      // waits on the network — gives the same feedback as every click after it.
      const setBusy = (button, busy) => {
        button.classList.toggle('is-loading', busy);
        button.setAttribute('aria-busy', String(busy));
        const spinner = button.querySelector('[data-quote-open-spinner]');
        if (spinner) spinner.hidden = !busy;
      };

      // Warm up on intent so the click itself is instant; harmless when it never comes. Both
      // listeners are dropped the moment booting starts — a `closest` on every hover in the
      // document is not something to keep paying for once the answer can no longer change.
      const prefetch = (event) => {
        if (event.target.closest?.('[data-quote-request-open]')) boot();
      };
      document.addEventListener('pointerover', prefetch, { passive: true });
      document.addEventListener('focusin', prefetch, { passive: true });

      function stopPrefetching() {
        document.removeEventListener('pointerover', prefetch);
        document.removeEventListener('focusin', prefetch);
      }

      // The only supported way to reach the modal without a button — see the doc block on top.
      window.MaximizeQuoteRequest = { boot };

      document.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
        const button = event.target.closest('[data-quote-request-open]');
        if (!button) return;
        event.preventDefault();
        setBusy(button, true);
        boot().then(() => {
          setBusy(button, false);
          window.Alpine?.store('xQuoteRequest')?.openFrom(button);
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>

  <script type="application/json" data-quote-request-config>
    {
      "moneyFormat": {{ quote_money_format | json }},
      "qtyLabel": {{ 'customer.order.quantity' | t | json }},
      "inStock": {{ 'products.product.inventory_status.in_stock' | t | json }},
      "soldOut": {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t | json }},
      "removeLabel": {{ 'bulk_order.remove_item' | t | json }},
      {%- comment -%}
        Both forms: the count only exists client-side, so Liquid cannot pick the plural itself —
        `variantCountLabel()` does. Same split as `collection-item-count`'s singular/plural settings.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      "variantLabel": {{ 'quote_request.variant_count' | t | json }},
      "variantLabelPlural": {{ 'quote_request.variant_count_plural' | t | json }},
      "productField": {{ 'quote_request.field_label' | t | json }},
      "summaryLabel": {{ 'quote_request.summary_label' | t | json }},
      "summaryUnits": {
        "products": {{ 'quote_request.summary_products' | t | json }},
        "variants": {{ 'quote_request.summary_variants' | t | json }},
        "units": {{ 'quote_request.summary_units' | t | json }}
      },
      "cols": {
        "sku": {{ 'quote_request.col_sku' | t | json }},
        "quantity": {{ 'quote_request.col_quantity' | t | json }},
        "empty": {{ 'quote_request.col_empty' | t | json }}
      },
      "priceFrom": {{ 'products.product.price.from_price_html' | t: price: '[[PRICE]]' | json }},
      "ruleLabels": {
        "inc": {{ 'bulk_order.rule.inc' | t | json }},
        "min": {{ 'bulk_order.rule.min' | t | json }},
        "max": {{ 'bulk_order.rule.max' | t | json }}
      }
    }
  </script>

  {%- comment -%}
    The markup ships INERT, inside a <template>: nothing in here is a live DOM node, so Alpine
    never walks these ~530 lines while the page is starting up, and the modal costs zero main
    thread time until a shopper actually asks for a quote. The boot script above clones it into
    the document on the first click — after `quote-request.js` has registered the store, because
    every binding in here dereferences `$store.xQuoteRequest`.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <template id="QuoteRequestModal__Template">
    <div
      x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.show"
      x-cloak
      class="quote-request popup-container{% unless settings.show_popup_overlay %} quote-request--overlay{% endunless %}"
      :class="{ 'quote-request--centered': $store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'success' }"
    >
      <div
        id="QuoteRequestPopup__Container"
        x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.show"
        class="quote-request__panel mx-auto w-[calc(100%-32px)] md:w-[calc(100%-64px)] popup-content{% unless settings.show_popup_overlay %} shadow-large{% endunless %} transform-gpu"
        :class="{ 'quote-request__panel--success': $store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'success' }"
        role="dialog"
        aria-modal="true"
        aria-labelledby="QuoteRequestPopup__Title"
        x-intersect.full="$store.xFocusElement.trapFocus('QuoteRequestPopup__Container', 'CloseQuoteRequestPopup')"
        @keyup.escape="$store.xFocusElement.removeTrapFocus(); $store.xQuoteRequest.close()"
        @click.away="$store.xQuoteRequest.close()"
        x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 translate-y-1/3"
        x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0"
        x-transition:leave-end="opacity-0 translate-y-1/3"
      >
        <div class="modal-title-container">
          <div class="modal-title-wrapper">
            <p
              id="QuoteRequestPopup__Title"
              class="h4 grow"
              :class="{ 'invisible': $store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'success' }"
            >
              {{- 'quote_request.title' | t -}}
            </p>

            <button
              type="button"
              id="CloseQuoteRequestPopup"
              class="modal-title__button-close"
              aria-label="{{ 'quote_request.close' | t }}"
              @click="$store.xFocusElement.removeTrapFocus(); $store.xQuoteRequest.close()"
            >
              <span class="button__close icon-close-medium-desktop icon-close-medium-mobile">
                {% render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-close' %}
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="quote-request__body flex flex-col min-h-0 flex-auto"
          x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.status !== 'success'"
          x-data="xContactForm('{{ quote_form_id }}')"
          @input.debounce.300ms="validateForm()"
          @change="validateForm()"
          @submit.prevent="isFormValid && $store.xQuoteRequest.submit($event.target)"
        >
          {%- form 'contact', id: quote_form_id, class: 'quote-request__form maximize flex flex-col min-h-0 flex-auto overflow-visible', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
            {%- if form.errors -%}
              <p
                class="flex items-center mb-3 flash-message error-message"
                data-quote-form-errors
                role="alert"
              >
                <span class="inline-block w-5 mr-2 rtl:mr-0 rtl:ml-2">{% render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-error' %}</span>
                {{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }}
                {{ form.errors.messages.email }}
              </p>
            {%- endif -%}

            <input
              type="hidden"
              name="contact[{{ 'templates.contact.form.form_type' | t }}]"
              value="{{ 'templates.contact.form.request_for_quote' | t }}"
            >
            <div hidden data-quote-products-fields></div>

            <div class="quote-request__scroll scrollbar-body scrollbar-visible flex-auto min-h-0 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden px-1">
              {%- comment -%}
                The heading and the column header stick to the top of the scroll area. They used to
                scroll away with the rows, which left a long list with no column labels. They stay
                INSIDE the scroll container on purpose — moving them out would make them miss the
                scrollbar width the rows lose, and every column would sit a few px off again.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="quote-request__sticky-head">
                <p class="mb-2 h5">{{ 'quote_request.products_heading' | t }}</p>

                <div x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.items.length">
                  <div class="quote-request__table-head-mobile grid gap-2 p-2 font-semibold lg:hidden color-text-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.8)] text-small uppercase">
                    <span>{{ 'customer.order.product' | t }}</span>
                    <span>{{ 'customer.order.total' | t }}</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="quote-request__table-head hidden lg:grid gap-3 p-2 font-semibold color-text-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.8)] text-small uppercase">
                    <span>{{ 'customer.order.product' | t }}</span>
                    <span>{{ 'bulk_order.column_inventory' | t }}</span>
                    <span>{{ 'customer.order.price' | t }}</span>
                    <span>{{ 'customer.order.quantity' | t }}</span>
                    <span>{{ 'customer.order.total' | t }}</span>
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p
                class="py-3 text-small opacity-60"
                x-show="!$store.xQuoteRequest.items.length"
              >
                {{ 'quote_request.empty' | t }}
              </p>

              <div class="quote-request__table" x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.items.length">
                <div role="list">
                  <template x-for="group in $store.xQuoteRequest.groupedItems" :key="group.productId">
                    <div
                      class="group quote-request__group rounded-corners overflow-hidden mb-0.5 border border-solid color-border-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.2)]"
                      :class="{ 'is-open': !group.isFlat && $store.xQuoteRequest.isGroupOpen(group.productId) }"
                    >
                      <div
                        x-show="!group.isFlat"
                        class="quote-request__row grid gap-x-3 gap-y-1 items-start p-2 duration-150 lg:items-center lg:relative quote-request__row--header cursor-pointer"
                        :class="$store.xQuoteRequest.isGroupOpen(group.productId) ? 'bg-transparent' : 'color-bg-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.02)]'"
                        @click="$store.xQuoteRequest.toggleGroup(group.productId)"
                      >
                        <div class="quote-request__cell-media row-span-2 self-start lg:self-center">
                          <template x-if="group.productImage">
                            <img
                              :src="$store.xQuoteRequest.imgUrl(group.productImage)"
                              :alt="group.productTitle"
                              width="52"
                              height="52"
                              loading="lazy"
                              class="w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-corners object-cover shrink-0"
                            >
                          </template>
                          <template x-if="!group.productImage">
                            <div class="w-[52px] h-[52px] overflow-hidden shrink-0 rounded-corners">
                              {%- render 'placeholder-image', image_type: 'product_2' -%}
                            </div>
                          </template>
                        </div>
                        <div class="quote-request__cell-info row-span-2 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-1 -ms-1">
                          <div class="quote-request__cell-name order-1 flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0 lg:-ms-1">
                            <span class="h5 md:h6 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden text-ellipsis" x-text="group.productTitle"></span>
                            <span
                              class="text-x-small opacity-60"
                              x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.variantCountLabel(group)"
                            ></span>
                          </div>
                          <div class="quote-request__cell-status order-2 flex items-center">
                            <div
                              class="product-info__inventory-status"
                              :data-inventory-status="$store.xQuoteRequest.groupAvailable(group) ? 'in-stock' : 'out-of-stock'"
                            >
                              <span class="product-info__inventory-label text-small flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span class="flex relative mx-1">
                                  <span class="product-info__inventory-dot animate-ping absolute flex h-full w-full rounded-full opacity-75"></span>
                                  <span class="product-info__inventory-dot flex"></span>
                                </span>
                                <span x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.groupAvailable(group) ? $store.xQuoteRequest.config.inStock : $store.xQuoteRequest.config.soldOut"></span>
                              </span>
                            </div>
                          </div>

                          <div class="quote-request__cell-price order-3 flex flex-col items-start color-text-[rgba(var(--color-price))]">
                            <span class="font-semibold h5 md:h6" x-html="$store.xQuoteRequest.groupPriceFormatted(group)"></span>
                          </div>

                          <div class="quote-request__cell-qty flex">
                            <span class="opacity-60">--</span>
                          </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="quote-request__cell-total col-start-3 whitespace-nowrap color-text-[rgba(var(--color-price))] pt-[3px] lg:pt-0">
                          <span class="font-semibold" x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.groupTotalFormatted(group)"></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="quote-request__cell-remove quote-request__cell-remove--header self-end flex justify-end">
                          <button
                            type="button"
                            class="flex cursor-pointer opacity-60 hover:opacity-100"
                            :aria-label="$store.xQuoteRequest.config.removeLabel + ' ' + group.productTitle"
                            @click.stop="$store.xQuoteRequest.removeGroup(group.productId)"
                          >
                            <span class="w-4 h-4 flex">{%- render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-remove' -%}</span>
                          </button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="quote-request__cell-toggle flex justify-end">
                          <button
                            type="button"
                            class="quote-request__toggle flex items-center justify-center w-6.5 h-6.5 p-1.5 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full color-bg-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.06)] color-text-[rgba(var(--color-text))]"
                            :aria-expanded="$store.xQuoteRequest.isGroupOpen(group.productId)"
                            aria-label="{{ 'order_view.toggle_variants' | t }}"
                            @click.stop="$store.xQuoteRequest.toggleGroup(group.productId)"
                          >
                            <span
                              class="quote-request__toggle-icon w-full h-full -rotate-90 rtl:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-200"
                              :class="$store.xQuoteRequest.isGroupOpen(group.productId) ? '!rotate-180' : ''"
                            >
                              {%- render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-caret' -%}
                            </span>
                          </button>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <div
                        class="quote-request__collapse overflow-hidden"
                        x-show="group.isFlat || $store.xQuoteRequest.isGroupOpen(group.productId)"
                        x-collapse
                      >
                        <template x-for="item in group.items" :key="item.key">
                          <div
                            class="quote-request__row quote-request__row--variant grid gap-x-3 gap-y-1 items-start p-2 duration-150 lg:items-center lg:relative"
                            :class="group.isFlat
                              ? 'color-bg-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.02)]'
                              : 'quote-request__row--child border-t border-solid color-bg-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.04)] color-border-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.06)]'"
                          >
                            <div class="quote-request__cell-media row-span-2 self-start lg:self-center">
                              <template x-if="item.image">
                                <img
                                  :src="$store.xQuoteRequest.imgUrl(item.image)"
                                  :alt="item.productTitle"
                                  width="52"
                                  height="52"
                                  loading="lazy"
                                  class="object-cover shrink-0 rounded-corners"
                                  :class="group.isFlat ? 'w-[52px] h-[52px]' : 'w-[45px] h-[45px]'"
                                >
                              </template>
                              <template x-if="!item.image">
                                <div
                                  class="overflow-hidden shrink-0 rounded-corners"
                                  :class="group.isFlat ? 'w-[52px] h-[52px]' : 'w-[45px] h-[45px]'"
                                >
                                  {%- render 'placeholder-image', image_type: 'product_2' -%}
                                </div>
                              </template>
                            </div>
                            <div class="quote-request__cell-info row-span-2 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-1 -ms-1">
                              <div class="quote-request__cell-name order-1 flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0 lg:-ms-1">
                                <span
                                  class="h6 md:h7 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"
                                  x-text="group.isFlat ? item.productTitle : (item.variantTitle || item.productTitle)"
                                ></span>
                                <span class="text-x-small opacity-60" x-show="item.sku">
                                  {{ 'customer.order.sku' | t }}: <span x-text="item.sku"></span>
                                </span>
                              </div>
                              <div class="quote-request__cell-status order-2 flex items-center">
                                <div
                                  class="product-info__inventory-status"
                                  :data-inventory-status="$store.xQuoteRequest.statusKey(item)"
                                >
                                  <span class="product-info__inventory-label text-small flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                    <span class="flex relative mx-1">
                                      <span class="product-info__inventory-dot animate-ping absolute flex h-full w-full rounded-full opacity-75"></span>
                                      <span class="product-info__inventory-dot flex"></span>
                                    </span>
                                    <span x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.statusText(item)"></span>
                                  </span>
                                </div>
                              </div>

                              <div class="quote-request__cell-price order-3 flex flex-col items-start p-break-words">
                                <span
                                  class="font-semibold h5 md:h6 !color-text-[rgba(var(--color-price))]"
                                  :class="{ '!color-text-[rgba(var(--color-sale-price))]': $store.xQuoteRequest.isDiscounted(item) }"
                                  x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.unitPriceFormatted(item)"
                                ></span>
                                <s
                                  class="quote-request__compare-at opacity-60 h6 md:h7 rtl:mr-1 !color-text-[rgba(var(--color-price))]"
                                  x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.isDiscounted(item)"
                                  x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.compareAtFormatted(item)"
                                ></s>
                                {%- comment -%}
                                  Shopify's unit price on its own line under the pair, the same shape the
                                  source rows use (variant-order-row.liquid, cart items). The string is
                                  whatever that surface rendered; blank when the variant has no measurement.
                                {%- endcomment -%}
                                <span
                                  class="quote-request__unit-price text-x-small opacity-60 color-text-[rgba(var(--color-text))]"
                                  x-show="item.measurementPrice"
                                  x-text="item.measurementPrice"
                                ></span>
                              </div>

                              <div
                                class="quote-request__cell-qty flex"
                                :class="{ 'pt-2.5': item.tooltipHtml }"
                              >
                                <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-1 relative">
                                  {%- comment -%}
                                    Volume pricing, lifted from the source row — same anchor + `x-html`
                                    pattern the bulk-order table uses, so one snippet keeps owning the
                                    price-break markup. `|| ''` is load-bearing: x-html would otherwise
                                    print the literal "undefined". The anchor sits on THIS wrapper, not
                                    on the stepper box below, because that box is `overflow-hidden` and
                                    would clip the icon.
                                  {%- endcomment -%}
                                  <span
                                    class="quantity-rule-tooltip-anchor inline-flex absolute right-1 -top-3 z-10"
                                    x-html="item.tooltipHtml || ''"
                                  ></span>
                                  <div
                                    class="inline-flex items-center rounded-corners-md overflow-hidden border color-border-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.2)]"
                                    role="group"
                                    :aria-label="$store.xQuoteRequest.config.qtyLabel + ' ' + item.productTitle"
                                  >
                                    <div
                                      class="flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-2.5 bg-transparent cursor-pointer select-none text-medium leading-none shrink-0 text-inherit"
                                      tabindex="0"
                                      role="button"
                                      @click.prevent="$store.xQuoteRequest.stepQty(item.key, -1, $el.parentElement.querySelector('input'))"
                                      @keyup.enter="$store.xQuoteRequest.stepQty(item.key, -1, $el.parentElement.querySelector('input'))"
                                      @mousedown.prevent
                                      aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.minus' | t }}"
                                    >
                                      <span class="w-3 h-3 flex color-text-[rgba(var(--color-text))]">{% render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-minus' %}</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <input
                                      type="number"
                                      min="0"
                                      inputmode="numeric"
                                      class="w-10 h-10 text-center text-medium border-0 bg-transparent outline-none text-inherit appearance-none"
                                      :value="item.qty"
                                      :aria-label="$store.xQuoteRequest.config.qtyLabel + ' ' + item.productTitle"
                                      @input="$store.xQuoteRequest.setQty(item.key, $el.value)"
                                      @change="$store.xQuoteRequest.setQty(item.key, $el.value, $el)"
                                    >
                                    <div
                                      class="flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-2.5 bg-transparent cursor-pointer select-none text-medium leading-none shrink-0 text-inherit"
                                      tabindex="0"
                                      role="button"
                                      @click.prevent="$store.xQuoteRequest.stepQty(item.key, 1, $el.parentElement.querySelector('input'))"
                                      @keyup.enter="$store.xQuoteRequest.stepQty(item.key, 1, $el.parentElement.querySelector('input'))"
                                      @mousedown.prevent
                                      aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.plus' | t }}"
                                    >
                                      <span class="flex h-3 w-3 color-text-[rgba(var(--color-text))]">{% render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-plus' %}</span>
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                  <span
                                    class="text-x-small opacity-60"
                                    x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.ruleSummary(item)"
                                    x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.ruleSummary(item)"
                                  ></span>
                                </div>
                              </div>

                            </div>

                            <div class="quote-request__cell-total col-start-3 whitespace-nowrap color-text-[rgba(var(--color-price))] pt-[3px] lg:pt-0">
                              <span class="font-semibold" x-text="$store.xQuoteRequest.lineTotalFormatted(item)"></span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="quote-request__cell-remove col-start-3 self-end flex justify-end">
                              <button
                                type="button"
                                class="flex cursor-pointer opacity-60 hover:opacity-100"
                                :aria-label="$store.xQuoteRequest.config.removeLabel + ' ' + item.productTitle"
                                @click="$store.xQuoteRequest.removeItem(item.key)"
                              >
                                <span class="w-4 h-4 flex">{%- render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-remove' -%}</span>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </template>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </template>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="quote-request__contact flex-none pt-5" :class="{ 'is-open': $store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen }">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="quote-request__contact-toggle flex items-center justify-between gap-3 w-full cursor-pointer text-start"
                :class="{ 'is-open': $store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen }"
                :aria-expanded="$store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen"
                aria-controls="QuoteRequestContactPanel"
                @click="$store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen = !$store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen"
              >
                <span class="h5">{{ 'quote_request.contact_heading' | t }}</span>
                <span
                  class="quote-request__toggle quote-request__toggle--contact flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 shrink-0 rounded-full"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <span
                    class="quote-request__toggle-icon w-3 h-3 flex transition-transform duration-200"
                    :class="$store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen ? '!rotate-180' : ''"
                  >
                    {%- render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-caret' -%}
                  </span>
                </span>
              </button>

              <div
                id="QuoteRequestContactPanel"
                class="quote-request__contact-panel pb-1 px-1"
                x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.contactOpen"
                x-collapse
              >
                <div
                  class="contact-form__email-error-{{ quote_form_id }} hidden flash-message error-message mb-1"
                ></div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 pt-2 md:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="text-field__wrapper">
                    <input
                      type="text"
                      id="QuoteRequestCompanyName"
                      class="text-field__input"
                      name="contact[{{ 'quote_request.company_name' | t }}]"
                      value="{{ customer.company_available_locations.first.company.name }}"
                      autocapitalize="words"
                      placeholder="{{ 'customer.enter_text' | t }}"
                      required
                    >
                    <label class="text-field__label" for="QuoteRequestCompanyName">
                      {{- 'quote_request.company_name' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">*</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>

                  <div class="text-field__wrapper">
                    <input
                      type="text"
                      id="QuoteRequestContactName"
                      class="text-field__input"
                      name="contact[{{ 'quote_request.contact_name' | t }}]"
                      value="{{ customer.name }}"
                      autocapitalize="words"
                      autocomplete="name"
                      placeholder="{{ 'customer.enter_text' | t }}"
                    >
                    <label class="text-field__label" for="QuoteRequestContactName">
                      {{- 'quote_request.contact_name' | t -}}
                    </label>
                  </div>

                  <div class="text-field__wrapper">
                    <input
                      type="email"
                      id="QuoteRequestEmail"
                      class="text-field__input"
                      name="contact[email]"
                      value="{{ customer.email }}"
                      autocomplete="email"
                      autocapitalize="off"
                      autocorrect="off"
                      placeholder="{{ 'customer.email' | t }}"
                      required
                    >
                    <label class="text-field__label" for="QuoteRequestEmail">
                      {{- 'customer.email' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">*</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>

                  <div class="text-field__wrapper">
                    <input
                      type="tel"
                      id="QuoteRequestPhone"
                      class="text-field__input"
                      name="contact[{{ 'templates.contact.form.phone' | t }}]"
                      value="{{ customer.phone }}"
                      autocomplete="tel"
                      placeholder="{{ 'customer.enter_text' | t }}"
                      required
                    >
                    <label class="text-field__label" for="QuoteRequestPhone">
                      {{- 'templates.contact.form.phone' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">*</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>

                  <div class="text-field__wrapper md:col-span-2">
                    <input
                      type="text"
                      id="QuoteRequestCompanyAddress"
                      class="text-field__input"
                      name="contact[{{ 'quote_request.company_address' | t }}]"
                      value="{{ customer.default_address.street }}"
                      autocomplete="street-address"
                      placeholder="{{ 'customer.enter_text' | t }}"
                    >
                    <label class="text-field__label" for="QuoteRequestCompanyAddress">
                      {{- 'quote_request.company_address' | t -}}
                    </label>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="text-area__wrapper field-container quote-request__notes flex flex-col mt-2">
                  <label class="text-area__label field-label--static" for="QuoteRequestNotes">
                    {{- 'quote_request.notes' | t -}}
                  </label>
                  <textarea
                    id="QuoteRequestNotes"
                    class="quote-request__notes-input text-field__input field-textarea--borderless flex-auto"
                    rows="3"
                    name="contact[{{ 'quote_request.notes' | t }}]"
                    placeholder="{{ 'customer.message' | t }}"
                  ></textarea>
                  {%- if settings.quote_notes_message != blank -%}
                    <p class="m-0 pt-2 text-x-small opacity-60">
                      {{ settings.quote_notes_message }}
                    </p>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex-none flex flex-col gap-2 pt-3 pb-4 md:pb-6">
              <div
                class="quote-request__alert flash-message error-message flex items-center gap-2"
                x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'error' || $store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'no_items' || $store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'load_error'"
                x-cloak
                role="alert"
              >
                <span class="w-4 min-w-[16px]">{% render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-error' %}</span>
                <span class="text-small" x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'no_items'">
                  {{- 'quote_request.no_items_error' | t -}}
                </span>
                <span class="text-small" x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'error'">
                  {{- 'quote_request.error' | t -}}
                </span>
                <span class="text-small" x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'load_error'">
                  {{- 'quote_request.load_error' | t -}}
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="quote-request__submit-bar flex flex-col items-stretch gap-3 p-4 md:p-2 border border-solid color-bg-[rgba(var(--color-text),0.04)] color-border-[rgba(var(--color-line-and-border))] md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-6 rounded-corners">
                <p class="m-0 text-center md:text-start text-small opacity-60">
                  {{ 'quote_request.submit_note' | t }}
                </p>
                <custom-button class="md:shrink-0">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="button button-primary button-medium relative"
                    :class="{ 'pointer-events-none': $store.xQuoteRequest.isSubmitting }"
                    :disabled="$store.xQuoteRequest.isSubmitting"
                    :aria-disabled="$store.xQuoteRequest.isSubmitting"
                    @click.prevent="emailTouched = true, validateForm(), $store.xQuoteRequest.attemptSubmit($el.closest('form'), isFormValid)"
                  >
                    <span class="button-text text-nowrap" :class="{ 'opacity-0': $store.xQuoteRequest.isSubmitting }">
                      {{- 'quote_request.submit' | t -}}
                    </span>
                    <span
                      class="inline-block w-5 h-5 animate-spin absolute top-[calc(50%-10px)] left-[calc(50%-10px)]"
                      x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.isSubmitting"
                      x-cloak
                    >
                      {%- render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-loading' -%}
                    </span>
                  </button>
                </custom-button>
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endform -%}
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 pt-3 pb-6 text-center"
          x-show="$store.xQuoteRequest.status === 'success'"
          x-cloak
          role="status"
        >
          <span class="quote-request__success-icon flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full message-success">
            {%- render 'icon-all', icon: 'icon-check-success' -%}
          </span>
          <p class="m-0 h4 md:h5">{{ 'quote_request.success_title' | t }}</p>
          <p class="quote-request__success-message w-full m-0 py-1 px-2 message-success text-small">
            {{- 'quote_request.success' | t -}}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
{%- endif -%}
